# Dock apps, in left-to-right order. Loaded by dock.sh (and read by macconfig-check.sh).
# Format (pipe-delimited): Display name | app path
#   @HOME@ -> $HOME at runtime. A * in the path is a glob and must not contain spaces.
# Blank lines and lines beginning with # are ignored.
Slack|/Applications/Slack.app
Granola|/Applications/Granola.app
Google Chrome|/Applications/Google Chrome.app
Ghostty|/Applications/Ghostty.app
CotEditor|/Applications/CotEditor.app
Cursor|/Applications/Cursor.app
Cursor Nightly|/Applications/Cursor Nightly.app
Grok Bot|/Applications/Grok Bot.app
Spotify|/Applications/Spotify.app
YouTube Music|@HOME@/Applications/Chrome Apps.localized/YouTube Music.app
